{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"Two additional entry paths matter. The REPL uses `cljs.reader` and passes pre-read forms to the frontend, so fixing `yang.clojure/read-forms` alone would miss it. Also, the compiler’s literal predicates don’t accept the JS Float64 carrier. I’ll include both in the future fix contract and rule against any attempt to infer float syntax from a bare Number."}}
